who never knew love's blaze?

1706
01:54:48.098 --> 01:54:49.338
I've seen her somewhere before.

1707
01:54:49.931 --> 01:54:51.240
She's the queen of Chanderi.

1708
01:54:51.264 --> 01:54:53.115
- What life has he lived,
- Yes, exactly.

