What life has he lived,

1715
01:55:10.389 --> 01:55:13.348
who never knew love's blaze?

1716
01:55:21.014 --> 01:55:22.181
Amazing!

1717
01:55:22.348 --> 01:55:26.598
If you seek true love,

1718
01:55:26.723 --> 01:55:30.681
Pray with power enough.

1719
01:55:31.098 --> 01:55:35.282
This is no road for the weak or meek,

1720
01:55:35.306 --> 01:55:38.865
Love calls for the brave,
the strong, the unique.

1721
01:55:38.889 --> 01:55:40.324
I'll get you something special. Wait.

1722
01:55:40.348 --> 01:55:41.048
Too good!

1723
01:55:44.306 --> 01:55:45.324
Alexander!

1724
01:55:45.348 --> 01:55:46.723
3000-years-old.

1725
01:55:48.306 --> 01:55:52.282
The one who never expressed his love
in any way,

1726
