who never knew love's blaze?

1737
01:56:32.389 --> 01:56:34.306
Mr. Alok, wake up.

1738
01:56:36.806 --> 01:56:39.126
Looks like the Englishman's blood
didn't sit well with you.

1739
01:56:46.806 --> 01:56:47.889
Where's Tarika?

1740
01:56:48.306 --> 01:56:49.348
She's gone.

1741
01:56:51.223 --> 01:56:52.223
Gone?

1742
01:56:53.181 --> 01:56:54.306
How can she just leave?

1743
01:56:56.056 --> 01:56:57.514
I sent her back...

1744
01:56:59.306 --> 01:57:00.306
with Veeran.

1745
01:57:05.098 --> 01:57:06.681
She didn't tell you everything.

1746
01:57:08.223 --> 01:57:09.223
About what?

1747
01:57:16.723 --> 01:57:17.723
Come on, Tadaka.

1748
01:57:18.223 --> 01:57:19.598
It's time to head back.

1749
01:57:20.056 --> 01:57:21.056
No.

1750
01:57:27.556 --> 01:57:29.098
You have to go back.

1751
01:57:29.723 --> 01:57:31.723
You broke the cardinal rule.

1752
01:57:33.764 --> 01:57:35.514
The day you bit Alok,

1753
01:57:36.056 --> 01:57:38.514
you knew this would happen.

1754
01:57:39.431 --> 01:57:41.181
Now Yakshasan will be free,

1755
01:57:41.389 --> 01:57:43.139
and you'll be locked up instead.

1756
01:57:43.598 --> 01:57:44.639
For a hundred years.

1757
01:57:45.056 --> 01:57:45.782
No.

1758
01:57:45.806 --> 01:57:47.806
I'm not leaving Alok.

1759
01:57:48.223 --> 01:57:52.681
You knew biting Alok meant
your imprisonment,

1760
01:57:53.306 --> 01:57:54.431
yet you broke the rule.

1761
01:57:59.306 --> 01:58:00.306
But Alok?

1762
01:58:00.931 --> 01:58:02.431
Bhediya is hunting him.

1763
01:58:03.389 --> 01:58:06.556
We'll keep Alok safe here.

1764
01:58:07.264 --> 01:58:08.848
But that means you have to go.

1765
01:58:11.306 --> 01:58:13.264
Do you want to save him or not?

1766
01:58:17.181 --> 01:58:19.473
I have no intention of dying together.

1767
01:58:20.931 --> 01:58:22.531
How about
we live together instead, hmm?!

1768
01:58:26.431 --> 01:58:28.598
Can I see him once before I leave?

1769
01:58:44.181 --> 01:58:49.657
Didn't think this is how we would part ways

1770
01:58:49.681 --> 01:58:54.949
I have so many things still left to say

1771
01:58:54.973 --> 01:59:00.514
Impossible that you
will ever escape my heart

1772
01:59:00.639 --> 01:59:05.824
Wish I could take us back to the start...

1773
01:59:05.848 --> 01:59:07.556
Tarika risked everything to save me?

1774
01:59:08.931 --> 01:59:10.139
Why didn't she tell me?

1775
01:59:11.264 --> 01:59:12.431
I have to go find her.

1776
01:59:12.806 --> 01:59:13.949
You're not going anywhere!

1777
01:59:30.056 --> 01:59:32.056
There's a dangerous Bhediya out there.

1778
01:59:33.431 --> 01:59:35.848
You'll stay in this city,
under our watch.

1779
01:59:36.473 --> 01:59:37.324
And Tarika?

1780
01:59:37.348 --> 01:59:38.348
Forget her.

1781
01:59:38.889 --> 01:59:39.889
Just forget about her.

1782
01:59:41.181 --> 01:59:42.639
Go home and stay low.

1783
01:59:42.806 --> 01:59:44.973
Don't step out unless I say so.

1784
01:59:46.181 --> 01:59:47.181
Understood?

1785
01:59:48.514 --> 01:59:49.514
Did you hear me?

1786
02:00:00.431 --> 02:00:01.431
Where were you all night?

1787
02:00:02.514 --> 02:00:03.514
Tarika's not home either.

1788
02:00:04.473 --> 02:00:05.473
She's gone.

1789
02:00:05.639 --> 02:00:06.639
Where to?

1790
02:00:07.264 --> 02:00:08.431
Back where she came from.

1791
02:00:10.056 --> 02:00:12.723
She broke their cardinal rule for me.

1792
02:00:14.348 --> 02:00:16.181
Now she'll be punished for it...
for eternity.

1793
02:00:18.473 --> 02:00:19.681
And I'll be stuck here...

1794
02:00:21.348 --> 02:00:22.348
without Tarika.

1795
02:00:24.431 --> 02:00:27.473
Maybe that's my punishment.

1796
02:00:30.473 --> 02:00:31.473
Goyal...

1797
02:00:33.639 --> 02:00:36.848
I thought hard after meeting that Padre.

1798
02:00:37.681 --> 02:00:40.181
Now I finally get it.

1799
02:00:41.014 --> 02:00:43.139
Whoever you are...

1800
02:00:44.389 --> 02:00:45.931
Dead or alive...

1801
02:00:47.431 --> 02:00:48.514
you're still my son.

1802
02:00:49.973 --> 02:00:51.264
You might drink blood...

1803
02:00:51.764 --> 02:00:53.431
but you're still my flesh and blood.

1804
02:00:53.848 --> 02:00:54.848
Go ahead, drink it.

1805
02:00:56.514 --> 02:00:58.889
I'm already 60.

1806
02:01:00.473 --> 02:01:03.431
For approximately the next 40 years,

1807
02:01:03.889 --> 02:01:05.889
Tarika's my daughter-in-law.

1808
02:01:07.056 --> 02:01:08.056
Daughter-in-law?

1809
02:01:08.723 --> 02:01:09.723
Look,

1810
02:01:10.056 --> 02:01:13.306
no one else can stay
with you this long anyway.

1811
02:01:13.806 --> 02:01:15.556
At least, not a human.

1812
02:01:17.639 --> 02:01:20.639
Your heart doesn't beat,

1813
02:01:21.348 --> 02:01:23.598
but it still loves Tarika.

1814
02:01:24.973 --> 02:01:27.764
That love helps you stay human.

1815
02:01:28.389 --> 02:01:31.056
Go... bring her back.

1816
02:01:32.306 --> 02:01:33.806
I can't, Dad.

1817
02:01:34.556 --> 02:01:36.723
Their rules won't let me leave.

1818
02:01:36.884 --> 02:01:38.967
What rules? Which rules?

1819
02:01:39.514 --> 02:01:42.848
Tarika broke every rule to be
with you, right?

1820
02:01:43.098 --> 02:01:44.098
Didn't she?

1821
02:01:44.556 --> 02:01:47.181
Then you should break every rule too,
just to be with her.

1822
02:01:47.556 --> 02:01:49.223
Come on now.
Come on. Get up.

1823
02:01:51.181 --> 02:01:52.181
Go, Goyal.

1824
02:01:52.431 --> 02:01:54.723
Enjoy your life after death.

1825
02:01:55.931 --> 02:01:57.181
Live long.

1826
02:03:35.848 --> 02:03:39.348
Thamma! Thamma! Thamma! Thamma!

1827
02:04:18.181 --> 02:04:23.056
I can't explain how good
I feel being free after 75 years!

1828
02:04:25.139 --> 02:04:26.681
That dark cave bored me to death.

1829
02:04:28.473 --> 02:04:30.056
While singing to kill time,

1830
02:04:30.514 --> 02:04:33.181
the throat-slasher got a sore throat.

1831
02:04:35.514 --> 02:04:37.014
Did you lot get a sore throat too?

1832
02:04:37.806 --> 02:04:39.098
Speak up!

1833
02:04:40.723 --> 02:04:42.740
Thamma!

1834
02:04:42.764 --> 02:04:43.990
Louder!

1835
02:04:44.014 --> 02:04:44.865
Thamma!

1836
02:04:44.889 --> 02:04:46.157
All together now!

1837
02:04:46.181 --> 02:04:48.740
Thamma! Thamma!

1838
02:04:48.764 --> 02:04:52.699
Thamma! Thamma!

1839
02:04:52.723 --> 02:04:54.889
I've been longing to hear this.

1840
02:04:56.014 --> 02:04:58.615
From today, your Thamma is free.

1841
02:05:01.764 --> 02:05:06.056
And from now on,
whatever I say becomes law.

1842
02:05:07.181 --> 02:05:08.657
We'll drink human blood,

1843
02:05:08.681 --> 02:05:10.032
spawn new Betaals,

1844
02:05:10.056 --> 02:05:11.098
build our army.

1845
02:05:12.348 --> 02:05:13.598
And she will be freed too.

1846
02:05:15.306 --> 02:05:16.306
Are you ready?

1847
02:05:19.639 --> 02:05:20.639
As you wish.

1848
02:05:22.389 --> 02:05:24.709
Meanwhile, will you do the honours
of chanting the mantras?

1849
02:05:26.389 --> 02:05:28.764
Can't you see I wanna break free?

1850
02:05:29.306 --> 02:05:30.282
Hurry up!

1851
02:05:30.306 --> 02:05:33.098
Thamma! Thamma! Thamma! Thamma!

1852
02:05:37.764 --> 02:05:40.098
Hundred years of toil and pain,

1853
02:05:41.264 --> 02:05:43.806
Hundred years bound in fire's chain,

1854
02:05:44.598 --> 02:05:46.264
Liberate the body's frame,

1855
02:05:47.514 --> 02:05:49.282
Liberate the soul the same.

1856
02:06:01.348 --> 02:06:02.348
Tadaka...

1857
02:06:03.681 --> 02:06:04.764
Thank you.

1858
02:06:05.806 --> 02:06:09.473
The first time you ran away
with that boy, I knew

1859
02:06:10.098 --> 02:06:11.723
"This is the girl

1860
02:06:13.014 --> 02:06:14.115
who'll free me

1861
02:06:14.139 --> 02:06:17.681
and trap herself in love...

1862
02:06:18.431 --> 02:06:19.449
and shackles too."

1863
02:06:22.931 --> 02:06:24.181
You could still be free.

1864
02:06:24.764 --> 02:06:27.806
But I'm sorry, he's not agreeing.

1865
02:06:28.848 --> 02:06:30.848
So now, thanks again,

1866
02:06:31.639 --> 02:06:33.139
from the bottom of my heart.

1867
02:06:34.806 --> 02:06:35.806
Bye-bye...

1868
02:06:36.223 --> 02:06:37.389
for a hundred years.

1869
02:06:39.931 --> 02:06:43.907
Thamma! Thamma!

1870
02:06:43.931 --> 02:06:44.740
Take her away.

1871
02:06:44.764 --> 02:06:45.824
Thamma! Thamma!

1872
02:06:45.848 --> 02:06:47.139
Excuse me, mister.

1873
02:06:49.889 --> 02:06:50.889
Alok?

1874
02:06:51.806 --> 02:06:52.806
Hi.

1875
02:06:53.014 --> 02:06:54.264
What are you doing here?

1876
02:06:54.806 --> 02:06:56.074
I'm here to taste a Barasingha.

1877
02:06:56.098 --> 02:06:56.824
What?

1878
02:06:56.848 --> 02:06:58.056
It's your favourite, right?

1879
02:06:58.264 --> 02:06:58.990
Alok!

1880
02:06:59.014 --> 02:07:00.598
I'm here for you, obviously.

1881
02:07:01.181 --> 02:07:02.701
You're getting locked up for 100 years

1882
02:07:02.848 --> 02:07:04.115
