1920
02:10:06.181 --> 02:10:10.723
Forget about a 100 years

1921
02:10:10.848 --> 02:10:15.556
Can't fathom going a moment without you

1922
02:10:15.806 --> 02:10:20.639
Even this means
that we perish in this flame

1923
02:10:20.806 --> 02:10:25.598
Whether or not I am there with you.

1924
02:10:25.764 --> 02:10:30.598
Whether or not I am there with you.

