1938
02:11:12.681 --> 02:11:14.973
Action in romance... I love it!

1939
02:11:42.306 --> 02:11:43.306
Hey...

1940
02:11:43.806 --> 02:11:45.389
You're not fit to be a Betaal.

1941
02:12:02.514 --> 02:12:04.223
That lover of yours...

1942
02:12:29.889 --> 02:12:32.014
Hundred years of toil and pain,

1943
02:12:33.889 --> 02:12:36.598
Hundred years bound in fire's chain,

1944
02:12:37.473 --> 02:12:39.264
Liberate the body's frame,

1945
02:12:39.973 --> 02:12:41.889
