Alok! Alok!

1957
02:14:48.139 --> 02:14:49.339
No... no... no... no way!
Alok!

1958
02:14:49.514 --> 02:14:51.223
Alok! Alok!

1959
02:14:51.848 --> 02:14:52.824
Alok!

1960
02:14:52.848 --> 02:14:53.915
ALOK!!!

